{"author":{"id":"89da5fec8eff6d69dbcdd68f81be7e9163b16f34b17e978ecf3554487379f453"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1774029030,"nonce":"Ig+bACyQ/uNoFxIg8S7BBzZt8pE=","title":"P5: Issue detail hub + EntityPill + cross-linking","message":"Parent: f3dbb3e\nDepends on: 8a281b3 (P4 — work-unit API), 81c9d85 (P2 — liveness data)\n\nIssue detail view as the navigation hub. Shared EntityPill component. Cross-linking across all tabs.\n\n## Issue context API (src/routes/issues.ts or new file)\n- GET /api/issues/:repo_id/:issue_id/context — returns:\n  - issue detail (title, status, labels, description, comments)\n  - work_unit (branch, state, continuation, assigned_session_id, liveness)\n  - active_session (id, type, console_session_id, status)\n  - sessions[] (all sessions linked to this issue with status and has_conversation flag)\n  - auth_requests[] (matching branch or issue_ids)\n  - branch_info (ahead, behind, last_commit_date)\n\n## Issue detail view redesign (ui/src/views/issues.tsx)\n- Status banner: state pill, assignment status, branch link, liveness indicator\n- Action buttons: Resume Work (spawn SDK agent), Start Agent, Open in Console, View Branch\n- Activity timeline: unified chronological feed merging sessions, auth requests, comments, handoff notes, state transitions\n- Related entities: clickable EntityPill chips for sessions, auth requests, conversations, child issues\n- Branch info section with link to Review tab\n\n## EntityPill component (ui/src/components/shared/EntityPill.tsx)\n- Shared component for all cross-tab entity links\n- Props: type (issue|session|auth|branch|conversation), id, label?\n- Renders as compact colored chip (type-colored, matching existing palette)\n- Click navigates to canonical view for that entity type\n- Hover tooltip with entity title/status\n- Reuse existing visual patterns from IssuePills/linked-session-chip but formalize\n\n## Cross-linking additions\n- Conversations tab: add issue EntityPills (from session_id → session_issues)\n- Projects/Work tab: add issue EntityPills on branch rows\n- Auth tab: add issue EntityPills from issue_ids/Bug trailers\n- Sessions tab: add conversation EntityPill link\n- Inbox items: add issue EntityPill on continuation/auth result items\n- Console tab: no changes (Console is the live workspace, not a cross-linking surface)\n\n## CSS\n- .entity-pill, .entity-pill--issue, .entity-pill--session, .entity-pill--auth, .entity-pill--branch, .entity-pill--conversation\n- Consistent with existing chip patterns, dark theme","files":null}]}